  "Full_Content": "<p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">General Studies (Paper - 1) 2021</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q1. Evaluate the nature of Bhakti Literature and its contribution to Indian culture.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q2. Trace the rise and growth of socio-religious reform movements with special reference to Young Bengal and Brahmo Samaj.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q3. Assess the main administrative issues and socio-cultural problems in the integration process of Indian Princely States.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 